Do you have forklift and reach truck experience and are you looking for a new opportunity in logistics? Then we have the perfect role for you!

What are you going to do?
As a Logistics Employee, your daily tasks will include:

- Loading and unloading incoming and outgoing goods;
- Operating a forklift and reach truck
- Receiving, checking, and storing products;
- Picking and preparing orders for shipment;
- Moving materials within the warehouse;
- Ensuring accurate inventory management;
- Keeping the warehouse clean, safe, and organized;
- Working together with colleagues to ensure smooth logistics processes..

What do we offer?
- Full-time position in day shift
- Starting salary of €16.17 gross per hour.
- Day shift working hours from 07:30 until 16:00;
- Travel allowance;
- Opportunity to work in a professional and stable organization;
- Training and development opportunities;
- Long-term employment prospects.

Where will you work?
The company is a leading provider of high-quality packaging solutions for the high-tech industry. The company specializes in the production, cleaning, management, and logistics of industrial packaging materials for customers around the world. Innovation, quality, and customer satisfaction are at the heart of everything they do.

What do we ask?
- Good command of English (minimum B1 level);
- A valid Forklift Certificate;
- A valid Reach Truck Certificate;
- Experience in logistics or warehousing is preferred;
- Ability to work accurately and independently;
- Reliable, proactive, and safety-conscious attitude;
- Available full-time.

